+/// GNX-FIX: reads a play / hold count (arg0): a whole number, or [min, max] for a random count, each 1-99
+/// with min <= max (numbers written as text are read). Returns [min, max], or undefined after a mod error
+/// that names cell arg1 and key arg2 (the caller then keeps its default). Before, [100, 120] became
+/// [100, 99] and anything above 99 slipped through.
+function gnx_parse_repeat_range(arg0, arg1, arg2)
+{
+    // is_array && length 2: [min, max]; otherwise one number for both
