+
+/// GNX-FRAMES: frame count of phase arg0 (0 start, 1 idle, 2 loop, 3 ej, 4 birth) for the current cell.
+/// arg1 = what a vanilla cell keeps. A cell with own frames gets its count, or the vanilla count of
+/// that phase when the JSON leaves the phase out.
+function gnx_cell_frames(arg0, arg1)
